      "value": "@{5c284bc2ad122e30a9c20746|full_name}: I just hit it by accident. Guess I wanted to crouch. Did you try to delete the cache and reupload a working avatar with the same id? That should work since the game will have to downlad the new avatar that works and everything is fine. The cache folder is in \"users\\yourname\\appdata\\locallow\\vrchat\". You can delete all of it it wont ruin anything but some of your time for the new download of maps and avatars.",
